`Art 56(1) the AI Office's duty to encourage and facilitate the drawing up of codes of practice` MEANS
    IF `Art 56(1) the AI Office must encourage and facilitate the drawing up of codes of practice at Union level` `the date asked` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN PARTY `Art 51 the AI Office`
