GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 56(6) the Commission may approve a code of practice by an implementing act and give it a general validity within the Union` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 51 the group applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter V applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Art 56(6) as enacted the Commission may approve a code of practice by an implementing act`  -- VERSION as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN NOTHING  -- VERSION as amended. NOTHING-kind (silent): the replaced paragraph 6 gives no power to approve a code by an implementing act

§ `Article 56(7): inviting providers to adhere`

