    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter V applies from the date Art 113 gives

-- "For providers of general-purpose AI models not presenting systemic risks this adherence may be limited to the obligations provided for in Article 53, unless they declare explicitly their interest to join the
-- full code." A permission for a provider not presenting systemic risks (outside it: NOTHING); "unless" is the text's own no (JUST FALSE once the provider declares its interest).
-- src:839 | 7. The AI Office may invite all providers of general-purpose AI models to adhere to the codes of practice. For providers of general-purpose AI models not presenting systemic risks this adherence may be limited to the obligations provided for in Article 53, unless they declare explicitly their interest to join the full code.
