      `it is appropriate to encourage and facilitate the review and adaptation of the codes of practice` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 51 official` `Art 56 act`
`Art 56(8) the AI Office's duty to encourage and facilitate the review and adaptation of the codes of practice` MEANS
    IF `Art 56(8) the AI Office must encourage and facilitate the review and adaptation of the codes of practice` `the date asked` `it is appropriate to encourage and facilitate the review and adaptation of the codes of practice` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN PARTY `Art 51 the AI Office`
         MUST `Art 56(8) encourage and facilitate the review and adaptation of the codes of practice`
         -- no time limit and no consequence in the text (listed in NOTES.md, Rules with no breach path)
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

